OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder arrests after man    
OL,4,Afound at address                       
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested on     
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man was    
OL,8,Ffound injured.                         
OL,10,FDorset Police said it received a report
OL,11,Fthat a man had been found injured at an
OL,12,Faddress in Frances Road, Bournemouth,  
OL,13,Fat 18:00 GMT on Thursday.              
OL,15,FOfficers attended alongside the        
OL,16,Fambulance service and the man, a       
OL,17,F71-year-old from Bournemouth, was      
OL,18,Fconfirmed dead at the scene.           
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
