OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder arrests after man    
OL,4,Afound at address                       
OL,6,FThree people ` a 51-year-old man, a    
OL,7,F43-year-old man and a 34-year-old      
OL,8,Fwoman, all of Bournemouth ` were       
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of murder and    
OL,10,Fremain in police custody. The force    
OL,11,Fsaid it was reported that the arrested 
OL,12,Fwoman and the deceased were believed to
OL,13,Fbe known to each other.                
